y(\sqrt{3}) = \frac{15\sqrt{3}}{3\sqrt{4}}
y(\sqrt{3}) = \frac{15\sqrt{3}}{3 \cdot 2}
y(\sqrt{3}) = \frac{15\sqrt{3}}{6}
y(\sqrt{3}) = \frac{5\sqrt{3}}{2}

